title: Confronting the Nazis
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: (nsdap_r >= 10 and nazi_urgency > 1) and confronting_nazis_timer == 0 and antifa_formed == 0
on-arrival: confronting_nazis_seen += 1; confronting_nazis_timer = 5; month_actions += 1
card-image: img/iron_front.png
tags: party_affairs; antifascism

# Forming Antifaschiste Aktion

The Nazis' strength is gaining, as shown by their recent election results and their violent presence in the streets. Their fascism threatens to plunge Germany once again into the abyss.

Many in our party are calling for urgent action. 

- @not_a_big_deal: The Nazis' moment will pass. Let's not get too hasty.
- @economic_crisis
- @major_crisis: We must do something to confront the Nazis.
- @antifa


@not_a_big_deal
on-arrival: nazi_urgency -= 1; conciliators_dissent += 5; labor_wing_dissent += 15

The Nazis are just another far-right movement that will die of its own contradictions sooner or later; we do not need to build a specific policy to combat them.

@economic_crisis
title: We must address the economic crisis first.
view-if: economic_plan == 0 and black_thursday_seen == 1
go-to: crisis_program

@major_crisis
view-if: nazi_urgency < 5
on-arrival: nazi_urgency += 1; labor_wing_dissent -= 5; labor_wing_strength += 5

The Nazis are one of the foremost threats to the German republic. However, we are still formulating a strategy to confront them, and still trying to build up consensus within our party for action. Check back on this later.

@antifa
title: Form Antifaschiste Aktion!
subtitle: Antifaschiste Aktion consists of the paramilitary and labor organizaitions of the KPD, and is open to a front with the SPD.
view-if: nazi_urgency >= 3 and antifa_formed == 0
on-arrival: antifa_formed = 1; radicalization += 1; nazi_urgency += 1; workers_kpd += 5*(1-dissent); pro_republic += 5*(1-dissent); conciliators_dissent -= 8; labor_wing_dissent -= 10; labor_wing_strength += 5
achievement: eiserne_front

The Nazi threat can no longer be ignored. We must build a new organization to confront them - Antifaschiste Aktion - consisting of the KPD, the Roter Front Kampferbund and the trade unions under our influence. We have a new symbol - the Dual Reg Flags.

What do the Red Banners stand for?

- @united_front: Unity among socialists and communists to oppose fascism.
- @anti: The red banner of communism is the only true opposition to fascism, monarchism, and authoritarianism.
- @orgs: The KPD, RFB, and unions.
- @popular_front: The unity of all workers against the fascist menace.
- @all: All of the above.

@united_front
go-to: if_end

@anti
go-to: if_end

@orgs
go-to: if_end

@popular_front
view-if: labor_plan_adopted == 1
go-to: if_end

@all
go-to: if_end

@if_end

Antifaschiste Aktion has given a new energy to our party.
